WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.390
Does drinking water lower blood pressure? Here's the short answer.

00:04.890 --> 00:09.710
Not directly. Water doesn't lower blood pressure the way your tablets do.

00:10.210 --> 00:17.290
But not drinking enough can leave you tired and dizzy, especially in hot weather, or if you take a water tablet.

00:17.790 --> 00:25.230
Choose water instead of soft drinks and sweetened juice. Extra sugar adds weight, and weight raises blood pressure.

00:25.730 --> 00:30.910
Go easy on alcohol and strong coffee. Both can push your blood pressure up.

00:31.410 --> 00:38.960
If you have heart failure or kidney disease, your doctor may limit how much you drink. Ask them first.
